<title>FINLAND: KEKKILA PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 6.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KEKKILA PROFIT SURGES TO FIM 6.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end June,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinaries, taxes    6.1 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		2.42 vs 0.09</p>
<p> Net sales					86.6 vs 83.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				8.0 vs 2.7</p>
<p> Operating margin			     12.6 vs 7.5</p>
<p> Net profit					6.1 vs 0.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish fertilisers and saplings maker is</p>
<p>Kekkila Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0240</p>
</text>
